    <section class="detail-section"><h2>Technical skills & languages</h2><p><strong>Proficient:</strong> Python, MATLAB, LaTeX, ROS 2</p><p><strong>Experienced:</strong> C/C++, Arduino</p><p><strong>Simulation & platforms:</strong> Gazebo, 2D swarm simulation, 3D EM propagation modelling, LEO Rover, Clearpath Jackal</p><p><strong>Languages:</strong> English and Welsh (fluent)</p></section>
    <section class="detail-section"><h2>Publications</h2><h3>Spatially Intelligent Patrol Routes for Concealed Emitter Localization by Robot Swarms</h3><p>Adam Morris, Timothy Pelham, Edmund R. Hunt</p><p>IEEE SSRR 2025 · Galway, Ireland · 29–31 October 2025 · pp. 108–114</p><p><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11391260">IEEE Xplore ↗</a></p></section>
